| ID | Frame | Canvas |
|---|---|---|
| 4023 | Glucose — Empty | 390×1000 |
| 4032 | Glucose — Form | 390×1000 |
| 4052 | Glucose — History | 390×1000 |
| 4062 | Glucose — Detail | 390×1000 |
